    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1LD_0RC1RB_0LD1RC_1LA0RC [SCycL 2 0; SWin 2] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

