    + exact run_ovf_1RB1LD_1LB1RC_0LD0RB_1RB1LA.
    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LD_1LB1RC_0LD0RB_1RB1LA p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LD_1LB1RC_0LD0RB_1RB1LA p j' E).
    + lia.
