    [exact Hst | reflexivity | reflexivity | exact (gso_1RB1LD_1LB1RC_0LD0RB_1RB1LA p j E)].
Qed.


(** An instruction that fires ONLY inside the interior lap: [vis_via_ovf] runs to an
